{"name":"Steel Legion Drab","hex":"#7a744d","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"steel","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An artificial metal produced from iron, harder and more elastic than elemental iron; used figuratively as a symbol of hardness.","Any item made of this metal, particularly including:\nBladed or pointed weapons, as swords, javelins, daggers."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Made of steel.","Similar to steel in color, strength, or the like; steely."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/steel"},{"term":"legion","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Numerous; vast; very great in number."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The major unit or division of the Roman army, usually comprising 3000 to 6000 infantry soldiers and 100 to 200 cavalry troops.","A combined arms major military unit featuring cavalry, infantry, and artillery, including historical units such as the British Legion, and present-day units such as the Spanish Legion and the French Foreign Legion."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/legion"},{"term":"drab","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A fabric, usually of thick cotton or wool, having a dull brownish yellow, dull grey, or dun colour.","The color of this fabric."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of the color of some types of drabcloth: dull brownish yellow or dun.","Particularly of color: dull, uninteresting."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/drab"}],"entries":[{"title":"Warhammer 40,000","blocks":[{"text":"Warhammer 40,000, is a British miniature wargame produced by Games Workshop. It is the most popular miniature wargame in the world, and is particularly popular in the United Kingdom. The first edition of the rulebook was published in September 1987, the eleventh and current edition was released in June 2026."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7c/Keno_mini_wargame.jpg/330px-Keno_mini_wargame.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Warhammer_40%2C000"},{"title":"Steel","blocks":[{"text":"Steel is an alloy of iron and carbon that demonstrates improved mechanical properties compared to the pure form of iron. Due to its high elastic modulus, yield strength, fracture strength and low raw material cost, steel is one of the most commonly manufactured materials in the world. Steel is used in structures, in bridges, infrastructure, tools, ships, trains, cars, bicycles, machines, electrical appliances, furniture, and weapons."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5d/%D0%90%D1%80%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%83%D1%80%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%82.jpg/330px-%D0%90%D1%80%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%83%D1%80%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%82.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steel"},{"title":"Steel blue","blocks":[{"text":"Steel blue is a shade of blue color that resembles blue steel, i.e., steel which has been subjected to bluing for protection from rust. It is one of the less vibrant shades of blue, and is usually identified as a blue-gray color. An archaic term for it is chalybeous."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e1/Niter_and_Color_Case.jpg/330px-Niter_and_Color_Case.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steel_blue"},{"title":"Drab (color)","blocks":[{"text":"Drab is a dull, light-brown color. It originally took its name from a fabric of the same color made of undyed, homespun wool. The word was first used in English in 1686. It probably originated from the Old French word drap, which meant cloth. In 1897 the Sears catalog listed household paint colors including drab, light drab, Quaker drab, and olive drab."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Beige_wool_texture.jpg/330px-Beige_wool_texture.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Drab_(color)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Operation_Sci-Fi_Con_2015.jpg/500px-Operation_Sci-Fi_Con_2015.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Operation_Sci-Fi_Con_2015.jpg/1280px-Operation_Sci-Fi_Con_2015.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Operation_Sci-Fi_Con_2015.jpg/500px-Operation_Sci-Fi_Con_2015.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AOperation_Sci-Fi_Con_2015.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Wh40k_painting_miniature.jpg/500px-Wh40k_painting_miniature.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Wh40k_painting_miniature.jpg/1280px-Wh40k_painting_miniature.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Wh40k_painting_miniature.jpg/500px-Wh40k_painting_miniature.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The assembly and painting of models is an aspect of the hobby as important as the game itself.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWh40k_painting_miniature.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b7/Topaketa_errunikoak_2011_0010.jpg/500px-Topaketa_errunikoak_2011_0010.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b7/Topaketa_errunikoak_2011_0010.jpg/1280px-Topaketa_err